ttps://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/deployments","created_at":"2025-07-28T19:19:18Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T08:19:27Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-27T21:23:52Z","git_url":"git://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:link-assistant/hive-mind.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind","homepage":"","size":577731,"stargazers_count":92,"watchers_count":92,"language":"JavaScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":14,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":371,"license":{"key":"unlicense","name":"The Unlicense","spdx_id":"Unlicense","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/unlicense","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTE1"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":14,"open_issues":371,"watchers":92,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"### Reproduction\n\nRun `/fix --ci-cd` on a repository with a required root-layout check that disallows arbitrary root files, such as link-foundation/link-cli. The initial draft commit can contain only the generated root `.gitkeep`.\n\nIn the observed [draft](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/pull/208), [commit 26852bd](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/commit/26852bd276b6cdeef98316fae6d2526e2de80483) created the placeholder. The [required JavaScript stage](https://github.com/link-foundation/link-cli/actions/runs/46067171135) failed with `.gitkeep should live under the package-specific project tree or case-study evidence`. The shared stage gate then prevented Rust and C# checks from running. link-foundation/link-cli#207 collects the logs. Earlier placeholder cleanup work in #1528 and #2215 addresses expensive path-filtered jobs and preventing a placeholder from leaking into a final merge. Required checks can still fail as soon as the draft opens.\n\nA local reproduction from a clean checkout of that repo is to add a root `.gitkeep`, stage it, and run `node --test js/test/repositoryLayout.test.mjs` (or run the JavaScript stage's `npm run test:js` command inside `js/`).\n\n### Workaround and proposed change\n\nRemove the generated file as part of the first real patch. Keep the repository's required checks and root allowlist in place.\n\nTeach the draft creation path to try a payload-free Git commit where the host accepts an empty comparison, or allow a repository-configured placeholder path before falling back to a root file. If GitHub rejects a compare without a content diff, use the configured path instead. Keep the existing cleanup and placeholder-only detection for the fallback. Add a regression that prepares a solver draft against a repository with an unconditional layout guard and verifies that a supported placeholder strategy leaves the required check green.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/4186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/4186/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"sha":"df13d3327ad27ce2bee0da0c7768c5982915b750","node_id":"C_k…NTA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/link-cli/git/commits/df13d3327ad27ce2bee0da0c7768c5982915b750","html_url":"https://github.com/